title: RDP Brute Force
id: 6e975d64-1370-4c22-8556-ff97379b2078
status: experimental
description: Detects a high volume of RDP (3389) connection attempts from a single source in a short window, indicating password brute forcing against exposed Remote Desktop.
author: Alaris Global
references:
  - https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1110/001/
logsource:
  category: firewall
detection:
  selection:
    dst_port: 3389
  timeframe: 5m
  condition: selection | count() by src_ip > 30
  condition: selection
fields:
  - src_ip
  - dst_ip
  - dst_port
falsepositives:
  - Connection-heavy legitimate RDP gateways
level: high
tags:
  - attack.credential_access
  - attack.t1110.001
